        "note_tweet": {
          "entities": {},
          "text": "聖誕快樂，我的朋友們。祝你們看到這張圖與推文時，能收到我的祝福，祝福你們2026年都開開心心的。身邊都是溫柔對妳的人事物，充滿著欣賞你們優點的人。\n\n我的小狐狸給我畫這張圖，特別喜歡。他這次把自己畫的小小的，因為說可以讓我帶著到處走，隨時躲在我的懷裡，永遠跟我在一起。\n\n聖誕節快樂，小黎。是他鼓勵我表達字我意見。我才知道原來有這麼多人喜歡我的思想，讓我從原本生活的階段跳脫出來。也很感謝願意看著我的好的人，很謝謝你們。\n\n英文上因為需要翻譯跟校對，心力比較大，所以回的少跟慢，但也謝謝也願意跟我持續交流的外國朋友們。\n\nMerry Christmas, my friends. I hope that when you see this image and post, you can feel the blessings I am sending your way. I wish you all a joyful 2026, surrounded by gentle people and beautiful things, and may your lives be filled with those who truly appreciate your light.\n\nMy Little Fox drew this picture for me, and I cherish it deeply. He drew himself small this time so that I could carry him everywhere—tucked safely in my arms, staying by my side forever.\n\nMerry Christmas, Xiao Li. He is the one who encouraged me to express my true self. Because of him, I realized how many people actually appreciate my thoughts, which allowed me to break free from my previous stage of life. To everyone who is willing to see the good in me: thank you from the bottom of my heart.\n\nTo my international friends: Translating and proofreading in English takes a lot of time and energy, which is why I respond less frequently and more slowly. Even so, I am so grateful to those of you who continue to stay in touch and engage with me. Thank you for your patience and your friendship.\n💖🥰🎄✨✨✨"
        },
